- Sessions directory: `/tmp/tpmjs-sandbox/sessions` (world-writable for deno user)
- Git credential helper: Reads `GITHUB_TOKEN` env var for auth
- Health check: HTTP endpoint at `/health`
- Permissions: `--allow-net`, `--allow-env`, `--allow-read`, `--allow-write=/tmp`, `--allow-run`
