### 6. Environment Variables Required

For **Layer 1** (sandbox-direct) in CI:
| Variable | Value in CI | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `SANDBOX_TEST_URL` | `http://localhost:3002` | URL of the Docker sandbox |
| `SANDBOX_TEST_API_KEY` | `test-ci-key` | Matches `EXECUTOR_API_KEY` in Docker container |
| `SANDBOX_TEST_DISK_QUOTA_MB` | `5` | Tells quota test what limit to exceed |
| `INTEGRATION_TESTS` | `true` | Enables test execution |

For **Layer 2** (E2E) in CI -- all existing secrets plus:
| Variable | Value in CI | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `AGENT_SANDBOX_URL` | Secret from GitHub | URL of the deployed sandbox server |

